==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~14 seconds<sup>400f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 4.67 seconds<sup>140f</sup>, delay 26.67~27.33 seconds<sup>800f~820f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Inky Doge]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 26.67~27.33 seconds<sup>800f~820f</sup>.
*1 [[Pinky Bear]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Clyde Gory|Clyde Gories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Clyde Gory]] spawns after 153.33 seconds<sup>4,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Blinky Kory]] spawns as the boss after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Blinky Kory is quite deadly here, as his magnification has skyrocketed to 250%. Because of this, you'll want to do your best to damage Pinky Bear with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dual]] [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragons]], and [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] up until he appears. Once Blinky Kory reaches the frontlines, pivot over to sending out bulkier [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]] like [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to damage him over time until he dies. If you have [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], use it to protect your backliners.

==Trivia==
*The level's name refers to the infamous [[w:File:Pac-Man split-screen kill screen.png|Level 256 glitch]] in the original ''Pac-Man'', where Level 256 is impossible to complete due to an integer overflow.

